        "Content": "LEONARD WILSON KEENAN ESTATE & LETTING AGENTS\r\nOur business is you....\r\n\r\nA BEAUTIFUL 3 BED / 2 BATH GROUND FLOOR HOME\r\nWELL MAINTAINED THROUGHOUT\r\nMOST SOUGHT AFTER DEVELOPMENT OF HOMES\r\n\r\nEARLY VIEWING STRONGLY ADVISED\r\n\r\nMulti Award Winning Team Patrick Leonard The City Centre Property Specialists are truly delighted to present this lovely home to the Dublin 4 property market.\r\n\r\nCharlotte Quay Dock is a most prestigious development of homes in the heart of Dublin 4.\r\n\r\nNo. 111 is sure to impress first time buyers, , parties trading up / down and investors alike.\r\n\r\nThe floor plan consists of: Entrance hall, store room, open plan living / dining room, separate kitchen, 3 bedrooms to include primary en suite and family bathroom.\r\n\r\nThe features of No. 111 include: Modern fitted kitchen with an abundance of base and eye level storage to include all integrated appliances, fitted wardrobes in two of the bedrooms and modern tiling / sanitary ware in both bathrooms.\r\n\r\nThe property further boasts double glazed windows.\r\n\r\nThe location is excellent making the city most accessible. Every conceivable amenity is on your doorstep.\r\n\r\nNo. 111 offers compete privacy and seclusion in the heart of the city.\r\n\r\nEarly viewing strongly advised.\r\n\r\n***All information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost of care and attention has been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases some information may have been provided by the vendor to us. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each and every viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have***"
